// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Superboard — Full Schema
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Includes all models required by the application.
// Tables with @@map() already exist in the database.
// New tables will be created via prisma db push.
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

datasource db {
  provider  = "postgresql"
  url       = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

// ── User (Tutor / Agency Owner accounts) ──

model User {
  id                    String    @id @default(uuid())
  email                 String    @unique
  name                  String?
  tier                  String    @default("FREE") // FREE | PRO | AGENCY | AGENCY_STANDARD | AGENCY_PREMIUM
  isAdmin               Boolean   @default(false)
  status                String    @default("ACTIVE") // ACTIVE | SUSPENDED | BANNED
  stripeCustomerId      String?   @unique
  stripeSubscriptionId  String?
  fingerprintHash       String?
  customDomain          String?   @unique
  parentEmail           String?
  under13               Boolean   @default(false)
  dataDeletedAt         DateTime?
  gracePeriodEndsAt     DateTime?
  // Referral system
  referralCode          String?   @unique
  referralCount         Int       @default(0)
  referralRewardClaimed Boolean   @default(false)
  referredByCode        String?
  // Agency fields
  parentAgencyId        String?
  brandingLogoUrl       String?
  brandingColor         String?
  agencyName            String?
  // Widget system
  installedWidgets      Json?
  createdAt             DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt             DateTime  @updatedAt

  // Relations
  rooms              Room[]
  templates          Template[]
  usageLogs          UsageLog[]
  sentInvites        AgencyInvite[]
  agencyMembers      AgencyMember[]       @relation("AgencyOwner")
  agencyMemberships  AgencyMember[]       @relation("AgencyTutor")
  bookings           Booking[]
  scheduleSlots      ScheduleSlot[]
  auditLogs          AuditLog[]
  students           Student[]            @relation("AgencyOwnerStudent")
  creditPacks        CreditPack[]
  homeworkAssigned   Homework[]           @relation("HomeworkTutor")
  homeworkAssignments HomeworkAssignment[] @relation("HwAssignmentTutor")
  lessonNotes        LessonNote[]
  invoicesCreated    Invoice[]            @relation("InvoiceCreator")
  subscriptions      Subscription[]

  @@index([parentAgencyId])
}

// ── Agency Member (sub-tutor relationship) ──

model AgencyMember {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId    String
  tutorId     String
  joinedAt    DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation("AgencyOwner", fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  tutor  User @relation("AgencyTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([agencyId, tutorId])
  @@index([tutorId])
}

// ── Agency Invite ──

model AgencyInvite {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId     String
  code         String   @unique
  invitedEmail String?
  recipientId  String?  @unique
  status       String   @default("PENDING")
  expiresAt    DateTime
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation(fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([status])
  @@index([code])
}

// ── Room ──

model Room {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId         String
  subject         String    @default("GENERAL")
  isActive        Boolean   @default(true)
  startedAt       DateTime?
  endedAt         DateTime?
  durationMinutes Int       @default(0)
  brandingLogo    String?
  brandingColor   String?
  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now())

  // Relations
  tutor        User              @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  pages        BoardPage[]
  chatMessages ChatMessage[]
  participants  RoomParticipant[]
  recordings   Recording[]
  lessonNotes  LessonNote[]

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([isActive])
}

// ── Board Page ──

model BoardPage {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId    String
  pageIndex Int
  snapshot  Json
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @db.Timestamp(6)

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([roomId, pageIndex])
  @@index([roomId])
}

// ── Template ──

model Template {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String
  name        String   @db.VarChar(100)
  description String?  @db.VarChar(500)
  subject     String   @default("GENERAL")
  gradeBand   String   @default("") @map("grade_band")
  tags        String[] @default([])
  isPublic    Boolean  @default(false) @map("is_public")
  snapshot    Json
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([isPublic])
  @@index([subject])
  @@index([gradeBand])
}

// ── Chat Message ──

model ChatMessage {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId      String
  senderId    String?
  senderLabel String
  content     String   @db.Text
  fileUrl     String?
  fileName    String?
  isPinned    Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @db.Timestamp(6)

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId, createdAt])
}

// ── Usage Log ──

model UsageLog {
  id                    String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId                String
  periodStartDate       DateTime @db.Date
  videoMinutesUsed      Int      @default(0)
  aiCreditsUsed         Int      @default(0)
  estimatedAiSpendCents Int      @default(0)

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([userId, periodStartDate])
  @@index([userId])
}

// ── Room Participant (tracks who is/was in a room) ──
// Maps to existing DB table with additional columns added.

model RoomParticipant {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid()) @map("id")
  roomId          String    @map("room_id")
  userId          String?   @map("user_id")
  role            String    @default("participant") @map("role")
  joinedAt        DateTime  @default(now()) @map("joined_at")
  leftAt          DateTime? @map("left_at")
  isOnline        Boolean   @default(false) @map("is_online")
  studentIdentity String?   @map("studentIdentity")
  studentName     String?   @map("studentName")
  studentId       String?   @map("studentId")
  lastActiveAt    DateTime? @map("lastActiveAt")

  room Room? @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([roomId, studentIdentity])
  @@index([roomId])
  @@index([userId])

  @@map("RoomParticipant")
}

// ── Booking (lesson bookings) ──
// Maps to existing DB table.

model Booking {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId      String
  studentName  String
  studentEmail String?
  parentId     String?
  slotId       String
  bookingDate  DateTime @db.Date
  startTime    String
  endTime      String
  status       String   @default("upcoming") // upcoming | completed | cancelled
  roomId       String?
  notes        String?   @db.Text
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([status])

  @@map("Booking")
}

// ── Schedule Slot ──
// Maps to existing DB table.

model ScheduleSlot {
  id        String  @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId   String
  dayOfWeek Int
  startTime String
  endTime   String
  timezone  String  @default("UTC")
  isActive  Boolean @default(true)

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])

  @@map("ScheduleSlot")
}

// ── Student (Agency student roster) ──

model Student {
  id                String    @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId          String
  email             String
  name              String?
  isActive          Boolean   @default(true)
  parentAccessToken  String?   @unique
  deactivatedAt     DateTime?
  createdAt         DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt         DateTime  @updatedAt

  agency User @relation("AgencyOwnerStudent", fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  homeworkAssignments HomeworkAssignment[] @relation("HwAssignmentStudent")

  @@unique([agencyId, email])
  @@index([agencyId])
  @@index([email])
}

// ── Audit Log (admin action trail) ──

model AuditLog {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId    String?
  user      User?    @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  action    String
  target    String?
  details   Json?    @db.JsonB
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([userId])
  @@index([action])
  @@index([createdAt])
}

// ── Recording (room session recordings) ──

model Recording {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  roomId       String
  tutorId      String
  startedAt    DateTime?
  endedAt      DateTime?
  durationSec  Int       @default(0)
  status       String    @default("recording") // recording | processing | ready | failed | deleted
  storageUrl   String?
  thumbnailUrl String?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId])
  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([status])
}

// ── Subscription (Stripe subscription tracking) ──

model Subscription {
  id                  String    @id @default(uuid())
  userId              String    @unique
  stripeSubscriptionId String?   @unique
  stripePriceId       String?
  status              String    @default("active") // active | past_due | canceled | trialing
  currentPeriodStart  DateTime?
  currentPeriodEnd    DateTime?
  cancelAtPeriodEnd   Boolean   @default(false)
  createdAt           DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt           DateTime  @updatedAt

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
}

// ── Platform Config (global settings) ──

model PlatformConfig {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  key       String   @unique
  value     Json?    @db.JsonB
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime  @updatedAt
}

// ── Invoice ──

model Invoice {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  creatorId       String
  studentName     String
  amount          Float
  currency        String   @default("usd")
  status          String   @default("draft") // draft | sent | paid | overdue | canceled
  dueDate         DateTime?
  paidAt          DateTime?
  items           Json?    @db.JsonB
  notes           String?  @db.Text
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  creator User @relation("InvoiceCreator", fields: [creatorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([creatorId])
  @@index([status])
}

// ── Scheduled Lesson ──

model ScheduledLesson {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String
  studentName String?
  studentEmail String?
  subject     String    @default("GENERAL")
  startTime   DateTime
  endTime     DateTime?
  status      String    @default("scheduled") // scheduled | completed | cancelled
  roomId      String?
  notes       String?   @db.Text
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([status])
}

// ── Credit Pack (agency credit system) ──

model CreditPack {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId  String
  credits   Int
  price     Float
  status    String   @default("active")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation(fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([agencyId])
}

// ── Homework ──

model Homework {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String
  roomId      String?
  title       String
  description String?  @db.Text
  dueDate     DateTime?
  status      String   @default("assigned") // assigned | submitted | graded
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  tutor User @relation("HomeworkTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([roomId])
}

// ── Lesson Note ──
// Maps to existing session_notes table.

model LessonNote {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId    String
  tutorId   String?
  tutor     User?    @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  content   String   @default("") @db.Text
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  room Room? @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId])

  @@map("session_notes")
}

// ── Webhook Config ──

model WebhookConfig {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId    String
  url       String
  events    String[]
  secret    String?
  isActive  Boolean  @default(true)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([userId])
}

// ── Question Item (question bank) ──

model QuestionItem {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String?
  type        String   @default("multiple_choice") // multiple_choice | short_answer | true_false
  subject     String   @default("GENERAL")
  difficulty  String   @default("medium")
  question    String   @db.Text
  options     Json?    @db.JsonB
  correctAnswer String? @db.Text
  explanation String?  @db.Text
  tags        String[]
 createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([subject])
}

// ── Homework Assignment (F-04 v1.3 — standalone board snapshot) ──

model HomeworkAssignment {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId         String
  studentId       String?
  sourceRoomId    String?

  // Identity & access
  assignmentToken String   @unique

  // Content (three separate snapshots — never merged)
  sourceSnapshot  Json     // the board as assigned (immutable)
  studentSnapshot Json     // student's work (updated by autosave)
  feedbackSnapshot Json?   // tutor's annotations (separate layer)

  // Metadata
  title           String
  description     String?  @db.Text

  // Status machine: assigned → in_progress → submitted → returned → reviewed
  status          String   @default("assigned")
  submittedAt     DateTime?
  late            Boolean  @default(false)

  // Two-date model
  dueAt           DateTime?
  submitUntil     DateTime  // dueAt + 7d, or createdAt + 30d
  viewUntil       DateTime  // submitUntil + 90d

  // Parent communication
  parentNotifyOnReview Boolean @default(false)

  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  tutor           User      @relation("HwAssignmentTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  student         Student?  @relation("HwAssignmentStudent", fields: [studentId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([studentId])
  @@index([status])
  @@index([assignmentToken])
}
